1
00:00:02,120 --> 00:00:02,858
Get on.

2
00:00:03,320 --> 00:00:03,628
Wait,

3
00:00:03,908 --> 00:00:05,502
I can't ride a horse!

4
00:00:05,570 --> 00:00:06,334
Hold on.

5
00:00:06,770 --> 00:00:07,719
Charge—!

6
00:00:08,055 --> 00:00:08,519
A-Ling,

7
00:00:08,572 --> 00:00:09,380
where'd you learn to ride?

8
00:00:09,984 --> 00:00:10,744
Don't talk,

9
00:00:10,799 --> 00:00:11,802
you'll bite your tongue.

10
00:00:12,276 --> 00:00:15,928
Mandatory mission: rescue Qin Shuang.

11
00:00:16,022 --> 00:00:18,738
Time remaining: two days.

12
00:00:18,854 --> 00:00:19,315
Yan!

13
00:00:19,736 --> 00:00:22,164
The Liuxi boys are here!

14
00:00:22,849 --> 00:00:24,757
A-Ling rides too fast,

15
00:00:26,202 --> 00:00:28,886
we rode mules for two days!

16
00:00:28,959 --> 00:00:30,182
These ruts are fresh.

17
00:00:30,246 --> 00:00:31,628
They're headed for the ford.

18
00:00:34,268 --> 00:00:35,648
Cross before dark.

19
00:00:35,727 --> 00:00:38,121
Once we're across, this person never existed.

20
00:00:38,200 --> 00:00:39,786
You're not prefecture men.

21
00:00:40,770 --> 00:00:41,923
Prefecture business,

22
00:00:41,992 --> 00:00:42,886
bystanders, get lost!

23
00:00:43,167 --> 00:00:45,164
A dozen blades…

24
00:00:46,395 --> 00:00:47,173
and how many are we?

25
00:00:48,175 --> 00:00:49,319
We don't need to win,

26
00:00:49,375 --> 00:00:50,647
just get the spear into her hands.

27
00:00:51,185 --> 00:00:51,927
Xu Yan!

28
00:00:52,610 --> 00:00:54,051
Qin Shuang—catch!

29
00:00:55,295 --> 00:00:56,542
Just in time.

30
00:00:57,102 --> 00:00:59,233
She caught it!

31
00:01:05,202 --> 00:01:06,342
Have a taste of my staff!

32
00:01:06,402 --> 00:01:07,394
Yan,

33
00:01:07,451 --> 00:01:09,423
I hit him!

34
00:01:14,279 --> 00:01:14,840
Now,

35
00:01:15,407 --> 00:01:16,346
it's my turn to take you in.

36
00:01:16,722 --> 00:01:19,353
Mandatory mission complete.

37
00:01:19,438 --> 00:01:20,568
A prefecture recall order!

38
00:01:20,731 --> 00:01:22,287
Who dares move?

39
00:01:24,228 --> 00:01:25,479
I know who she is.

40
00:01:26,469 --> 00:01:27,132
Who she is,

41
00:01:27,197 --> 00:01:28,321
is hers to say.

42
00:01:28,380 --> 00:01:30,898
A-Ling, affection: fifty-nine.

43
00:01:31,251 --> 00:01:32,391
Hands off.

44
00:01:34,678 --> 00:01:35,588
Let me go,

45
00:01:36,554 --> 00:01:37,989
and you get the letter to your father.

46
00:01:38,046 --> 00:01:39,155
My father's…

47
00:01:39,926 --> 00:01:40,790
letter?

48
00:01:41,069 --> 00:01:41,581
Qin Shuang,

49
00:01:41,636 --> 00:01:42,245
your call.

50
00:01:42,588 --> 00:01:43,685
Want the letter?

51
00:01:43,793 --> 00:01:44,849
Then let me go.
